@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 09. Supervisor Agent Security Model

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Input Guard" {
  [SupervisorA2AController] as SupervisorA2AController
  [PromptInjectionGuard] as PromptGuard
  [PII Validation/Masking] as PiiGuard
}

rectangle "Routing & Invocation Guard" {
  [A2AClientRegistry] as Registry
  [Endpoint Allowlist] as Allowlist
  [A2AInvocationService] as Invoker
  [Handoff Policy Service] as HandoffPolicy
  [Handoff Method Enum Guard] as MethodGuard
  [Streaming Capability Guard] as StreamGuard
  [Timeout/Retry Policy] as TimeoutRetry
  [Circuit Breaker] as CircuitBreaker
  [Payload Size Guard] as PayloadGuard
}

rectangle "Error Safety" {
  [GlobalExceptionHandler] as ErrorHandler
}

rectangle "HITL Safety Gate" {
  [HitlPolicyService] as HitlPolicy
  [HitlDecisionService] as HitlDecision
  [Swarm State Integrity Check] as SwarmIntegrity
}

SupervisorA2AController --> PromptGuard : sanitize user text
SupervisorA2AController --> PiiGuard : validate/mask name/phone/email
Invoker --> Registry : resolve target
Registry --> Allowlist : validate agent key/endpoint
Invoker --> TimeoutRetry : bounded call
Invoker --> CircuitBreaker : fail-fast on repeated errors
Invoker --> PayloadGuard : truncate/validate payload
HandoffPolicy --> MethodGuard : validate method enum
HandoffPolicy --> StreamGuard : validate stream support
ErrorHandler --> Invoker : sanitize exception mapping
HitlPolicy --> HitlDecision : mandatory review for data mutation
HitlDecision --> SwarmIntegrity : decision/version validation

note right of Allowlist
Supervisor agent can call only
- product A2A endpoint
- reservation A2A endpoint
- search A2A endpoint
end note

note right of HandoffPolicy
Handoff hardening
- feature flag (`handoff.enabled`)
- allowed method enum only
- block stream handoff for non-stream-capable agent
- max hops / duplicate path guard
end note

note bottom of ErrorHandler
No sensitive leak
- internal stack
- downstream raw headers/body
- credentials
end note

